  <name>DraftRight</name>
  <summary>AI-powered text rewriting</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      DraftRight lets you select text anywhere on your desktop, pick a tone,
      and get a polished rewrite in place.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Global shortcut to capture the current selection</li>
      <li>Tones including simple, natural, polished, concise, and technical</li>
      <li>Grammar check and translation</li>
      <li>Replace the selection directly or copy the result</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

